        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Trinity\n- People: Claire Skinner, Charles Dance, Antonia Bernath, Christian Cooke, Reggie Yates, Isabella Calthorpe\n- Organizations: ITV2, BBC\n- Places: Trinity College, Bridgeford University\n\nFacts:\n- Claire Skinner was born in 1965 and is an English actress.\n- Claire Skinner is known in the United Kingdom for her television career, particularly for playing Sue Brockman in the BBC television series Outnumbered.\n- Trinity is a British drama series that was broadcast on ITV2 from September to November 2009.\n- Trinity is set in the fictional Trinity College of Bridgeford University.\n- Trinity stars Charles Dance, Claire Skinner, Antonia Bernath, Christian Cooke, Reggie Yates, and Isabella Calthorpe.",
